<p id="S4.T2.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.T2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;">Note.<span id="S4.T2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Significance codes: <math id="S4.T2.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}^{*}p&lt;.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{*}p&lt;.05</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}^{**}p&lt;.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>p</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{**}p&lt;.01</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T2.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}^{***}p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo lspace="0em">∗</mo></mrow></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{***}p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="S4.T2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes rank-based effect size.</span></span></p></div></div>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.09870v1/posthoc_condition_medians_clean.svg" id="S4.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/271;" width="476" height="271"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7. </span>Post hoc Mann–Whitney <math id="S4.F7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> comparisons (Bonferroni-adjusted, <math id="S4.F7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=.05</annotation></semantics></math>) for the medium vs low (left) and high (right) across six outcomes. Points show group medians; circle size encodes |rank–biserial <math id="S4.F7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>| (.10/.30/.50). Arrows mark pairs with Bonferroni-corrected <math id="S4.F7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\leq.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\leq.05</annotation></semantics></math> and point toward the higher median. Medium CA <math id="S4.F7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> low for all six constructs; medium <math id="S4.F7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> high for Likeability and Intelligence only (others n.s.).</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Bonferroni-adjusted Mann–Whitney <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> tests (<math id="S4.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=.017" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.017</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=.017</annotation></semantics></math>) showed that the medium condition consistently outperformed the low condition on all identified above (see Figure <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 4.1. Effects of CA Personality (RQ1) ‣ 4. Results ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.1. Effects of CA Personality (RQ1) ‣ 4. Results ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). For Intelligence (medium: 4.60 vs. low: 4.00), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=850.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>850.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=850.0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.016" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.016</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.016</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.276" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.276</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.276</annotation></semantics></math>; the medium condition also outperformed the high condition (medium: 4.60 vs. high: 4.00), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=1605.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1605.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=1605.5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.039" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.039</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.039</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.245" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.245</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.245</annotation></semantics></math>. Similar patterns were observed for Enjoyment (medium: 6.00 vs. low: 5.17), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=847.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>847.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=847.0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.015" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.015</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.015</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.278" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.278</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.278</annotation></semantics></math>; and for Anthropomorphism (medium: 3.60 vs. low: 2.80), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=789.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>789.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=789.5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.005" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.005</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.317" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.317</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.317</annotation></semantics></math>. Intention to Adopt likewise favored the medium condition (medium: 5.50 vs. low: 4.00), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=792.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>792.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=792.0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.005" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.005</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.316" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.316</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.316</annotation></semantics></math>. For Trust, medium (<math id="S4.SS1.p3.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{Mdn}=5.90" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑀𝑑𝑛</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{Mdn}=5.90</annotation></semantics></math>) exceeded low (<math id="S4.SS1.p3.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{Mdn}=5.35" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑀𝑑𝑛</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{Mdn}=5.35</annotation></semantics></math>), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=826.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>826.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=826.5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.011" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.011</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.011</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.292" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.292</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.292</annotation></semantics></math>. Finally, for Likeability (medium: 4.80 vs. low: 4.00), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=700.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>700.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=700.5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.379" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.379</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.379</annotation></semantics></math>; the medium condition also outperformed the high condition (medium: 4.80 vs. high: 4.30), <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U=1692.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1692.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U=1692.0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.006" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.006</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.006</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=.305" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.305</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=.305</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
