<p id="S4.T6.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.T6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;">Note.<span id="S4.T6.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Significance codes: <math id="S4.T6.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}^{*}p&lt;.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{*}p&lt;.05</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}^{**}p&lt;.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>p</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{**}p&lt;.01</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T6.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}^{***}p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo lspace="0em">∗</mo></mrow></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{***}p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="S4.T6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes rank-based effect size.</span></span></p></div></div>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.09870v1/posthoc_cluster_medians_clean.svg" id="S4.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/271;" width="476" height="271"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10. </span>Post hoc Mann–Whitney <math id="S4.F10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> results (Bonferroni-adjusted, <math id="S4.F10.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=.05</annotation></semantics></math>) comparing the Well-Aligned cluster (C2) with Extraversion-Misaligned (C0, left) and Globally-Misaligned (C1, right). Points show cluster medians; circle size encodes <math id="S4.F10.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|r|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|r|</annotation></semantics></math> (.10/.30/.50). Arrows mark pairs with Bonferroni-corrected <math id="S4.F10.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\leq.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\leq.05</annotation></semantics></math> and point toward the higher median. C2 <math id="S4.F10.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> C0 for Intelligence, Trust, and Likeability (others n.s.). C2 <math id="S4.F10.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> C1 for all six outcomes (Intelligence, Enjoyment, Trust, Intention to Adopt, Anthropomorphism, Likeability).</figcaption>
</figure>
