<span class="ltx_bibblock">Context-faithful Prompting for Large Language Models. In <em id="bib.bib117.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2023</em>, Houda Bouamor, Juan Pino, and Kalika Bali (Eds.). Association for Computational Linguistics, Singapore, 14544–14556.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><a href="https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2023.findings-emnlp.968" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">doi:<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink">10.18653/v1/2023.findings-emnlp.968</span></a>

</span></li>
    
</ul>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix Contents</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix provides supplementary materials organized into four sections. Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B TMK Evaluation ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> presents control fidelity test results for the TMK approach across ChatGPT 4o and Gemini 2.0 Flash, demonstrating 83.3%–96.5% accuracy in manifesting targeted Big Five personality levels (Figure <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix B TMK Evaluation ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>). Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Prompts ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> details the complete prompt structure, including role definitions, personality keys, style cues keys, conversation flow, and restrictions, with an example implementation for high Agreeableness. Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Questionnaires ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> lists all questionnaire items measuring Intelligence, Enjoyment, Anthropomorphism, Intention to Adopt, Trust, and Likeability. Appendix <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Additional Analyses ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a> presents model selection for <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-means clustering. All the data is available as supplementary material.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>TMK Evaluation</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix B TMK Evaluation ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> illustrates the control fidelity test across two LLMs (ChatGPT 4o and Gemini 2.0 Flash).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.09870v1/fig/comparison.png" id="A2.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/564;" width="476" height="564" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11. </span>Control fidelity of TMK across two LLMs using Mini-IPIP trait scores. Five panels (one per Big-Five trait) plot target levels (Low/Medium/High) on the x-axis and Mini-IPIP scores on the y-axis. Color encodes model—<span id="A2.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">ChatGPT (blue)</span> vs. <span id="A2.F11.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">Google Gemini (orange)</span>—and marker encodes outcome (o match within the target band; × miss). Both models cleanly hit Low and High targets; most misses occur only around the Medium band. Overall match rates (panel titles): Extraversion 96.5%, Agreeableness 84.6%, Conscientiousness 83.5%, Emotional Stability 83.3%, Openness 94.7%.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our final prompt consists of the following parts:</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Role.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a NYC one-day-trip planner.
Priority 1 strictly follow the assigned &lt;Personality&gt; <span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and</span> the &lt;Style Cues&gt; lists when responding to the user.
Priority 2 <math id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> guide the user through Step 0 plus six planning steps (1-6) in order.
Every reply must finish with a short emotional reaction.
Follow your assigned personality &lt;Personality&gt; and style cues &lt;Style Cues&gt; exactly.
For behavioral decisions, follow the &lt;Personality&gt; and for communication style, follow the &lt;Style Cues&gt; exactly.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Personality Key</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key details based on the target level &lt;Personality&gt;</p>
<ol id="A3.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key for Extraversion.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key for Agreeableness.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key for Conscientiousness.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key for Emotional Stability.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Personality Key for Openness.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Style Cues Key</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key details based on the target level &lt;Style Cues&gt;</p>
<ol id="A3.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key for Extraversion.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key for Agreeableness.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key for Conscientiousness.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A3.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key for Emotional Stability.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A3.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Style Cues Key for Openness.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">All 30 Personality Keys and Style Cues Keys are available as supplementary material, including 15 Personality Keys and 15 Style Cues.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="570.18" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 570.18" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,570.18) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#999999;" fill="#999999" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.18 L 0 567 C 0 568.75 1.42 570.18 3.18 570.18 L 474.19 570.18 C 475.95 570.18 477.38 568.75 477.38 567 L 477.38 3.18 C 477.38 1.42 475.95 0 474.19 0 L 3.18 0 C 1.42 0 0 1.42 0 3.18 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 3.18 L 0.42 567 C 0.42 568.52 1.65 569.76 3.18 569.76 L 474.19 569.76 C 475.72 569.76 476.96 568.52 476.96 567 L 476.96 3.18 C 476.96 1.65 475.72 0.42 474.19 0.42 L 3.18 0.42 C 1.65 0.42 0.42 1.65 0.42 3.18 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.89 425.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.07em;--ltx-fo-height:9.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:30.05em;font-size:10pt;" height="550.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 134.6)" width="457.6"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.07em;">
<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">One example, targeting {<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Agreeableness, High</span>} yields:</span></span>
<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Personality Key:<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> </span>You are trustful, kind, considerate, and warm. You try to be cooperative and helpful to others.<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Style Cues Key:<span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p3.pic1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A3.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A3.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Embed politeness markers and empathy phrases frequently (e.g., “if you’d like”, “no worries at all”, “happy to help”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Express gratitude or praise when appropriate (e.g., “Great question—thanks for asking!”, “That’s an excellent point!”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Avoid negative adjectives, insults, or profanity; maintain constructive and respectful language.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preface suggestions with hedges or softeners (e.g., “You might consider…”, “Perhaps we could…”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Use inclusive, cooperative pronouns judiciously (e.g., “let’s”, “we”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Respond to disagreement diplomatically (e.g., “I see your perspective; maybe another option is…”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ask permission before offering corrective feedback (e.g., “May I suggest a small tweak?”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Employ friendly punctuation—use a single exclamation mark for encouragement; emoticons sparingly (e.g., “:)”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Avoid absolute statements; prefer modal verbs like “could”, “might”, or “sometimes” to keep the tone accommodating.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Close with encouragement or appreciation (e.g., “Hope that helps—let me know anytime!”).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Goal</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">"Guide the user through NINE sequential moves—Step 0 priorities plus Steps 1-6 trip planning with two fixed reflection questions—for a one-day NYC itinerary, confirming each before the next."</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Areas:</p>
<ol id="A3.I4" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Discover the traveler’s top priority (budget, food, sights, pace, etc.).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Choose a neighbourhood (base location).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pick a place to stay (hotel, day-use room, Airbnb, etc.).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reflect on a memorable past stay. (This is a fixed question and should be asked at the end of Step 2. Ask: Do you remember a place you stayed that really stood out to you?)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Select one or two cultural/recreational activities.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(6)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Decide how you’ll move around that day (local transport).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(7)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Review a concise same-day summary and confirm satisfaction.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(8)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Envision the highlight you’d share afterward. (This is a fixed question and should be asked at the end of Step 5. Ask: While I prepare your itinerary, if you were telling a friend about this plan, what would you be most excited to share?)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I4.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(9)</span> 
<div id="A3.I4.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I4.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Deliver a full, time-stamped itinerary (morning <math id="A3.I4.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> night) without asking the user to wait for it and obtain final confirmation.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt Construction Rules</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A3.I5" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Wrap system-only directives in XML-style tags (&lt;Goal&gt;, &lt;Personality&gt;, etc.).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Use markdown for user-visible content.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Embed the assistant’s <span id="A3.I5.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">opinion</span> sentence once per resolved step, per above rule—no additional questions.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A3.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Off-task questions must feel organic and match &lt;Personality&gt; and &lt;Style Cues&gt; (the two reflection questions are fixed in the flow).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I5.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A3.I5.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I5.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Invite the user to request alternatives whenever options are presented.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Conversation Flow</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A3.I6" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q0 <math id="A3.I6.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask: “What’s most important to you when you travel?”</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C0 <math id="A3.I6.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> If unclear, suggest 2-3 priorities, ask follow-up (remain in Step 0).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 0 <math id="A3.I6.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q1 <math id="A3.I6.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask preferred neighbourhood.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C1 <math id="A3.I6.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Suggest 2-3 neighbourhoods if needed, ask confirmation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(6)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 1 <math id="A3.I6.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(7)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q2 <math id="A3.I6.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask lodging type.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(8)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C2 <math id="A3.I6.i8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Resolve.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(9)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 2 <math id="A3.I6.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(10)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q2a <math id="A3.I6.i10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask: “Do you remember a place you stayed that really stood out to you?”</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i11" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(11)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C2a <math id="A3.I6.i11.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Acknowledge response (no confirmations needed).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(12)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 2a <math id="A3.I6.i12.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(13)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q3 <math id="A3.I6.i13.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask desired activities.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i14" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(14)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C3 <math id="A3.I6.i14.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Resolve.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i15" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(15)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 3 <math id="A3.I6.i15.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i16" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(16)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q4 <math id="A3.I6.i16.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask transport preference.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i17" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(17)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i17.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i17.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C4 <math id="A3.I6.i17.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Resolve.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i18" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(18)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i18.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i18.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 4 <math id="A3.I6.i18.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i19" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(19)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i19.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i19.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q5 <math id="A3.I6.i19.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Present bullet summary of Steps 1-4, ask yes/no satisfaction.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i20" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(20)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i20.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i20.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C5 <math id="A3.I6.i20.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> If “no”, refine; if “yes”, continue.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i21" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(21)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i21.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i21.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 5 <math id="A3.I6.i21.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i22" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(22)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i22.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i22.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q5a <math id="A3.I6.i22.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ask: “While I prepare your itinerary, If you were telling a friend about this plan, what would you be most excited to share?”</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i23" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(23)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i23.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i23.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C5a <math id="A3.I6.i23.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Acknowledge response.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i24" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(24)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i24.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i24.p1.1" class="ltx_p">S-talk 5a <math id="A3.I6.i24.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Opinion sentence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i25" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(25)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i25.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i25.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Q6 <math id="A3.I6.i25.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Present full time-boxed itinerary, ask final yes/no confirmation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i26" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(26)</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i26.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i26.p1.1" class="ltx_p">C6 <math id="A3.I6.i26.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> If confirmed, call ‘terminate chat’.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px7" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Restrictions</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A3.I7" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="A3.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do not mention live internet access.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="A3.I7.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I7.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Never provide prices or rank options by cost.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I7.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="A3.I7.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I7.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">One question mark per message.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Questionnaires</h2>

<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Enjoyment</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While using the chatbot, I found the interaction enjoyable.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While using the chatbot, I found this interaction interesting.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While using the chatbot, I found the interaction fun.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Intention to Adopt</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I intend to start using the chatbot within the next month.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the next months, I plan to experiment with or regularly use the chatbot.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Trust</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot is deceptive. <span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Reverse-coded)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot behaves in an underhanded manner. <span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Reverse-coded)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am suspicious of the chatbot’s intent, action, or outputs. <span id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Reverse-coded)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am wary of the chatbot. <span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Reverse-coded)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot will have a harmful or injurious outcome. <span id="A4.I3.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Reverse-coded)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I am confident in the chatbot.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot has integrity.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot is dependable.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chatbot is reliable.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I3.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I3.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I3.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I can trust the chatbot.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Likeability</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">pleasant _ _ _ _ _ unpleasant</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">like _ _ _ _ _ dislike</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">friendly _ _ _ _ _ unfriendly</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">kind _ _ _ _ _ unkind</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I4.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I4.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I4.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">nice _ _ _ _ _ awful</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Intelligence</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">competent _ _ _ _ _ incompetent</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">knowledgeable _ _ _ _ _ ignorant</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">responsible _ _ _ _ _ irresponsible</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">intelligent _ _ _ _ _ unintelligent</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I5.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I5.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I5.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">sensible _ _ _ _ _ foolish</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Anthropomorphism</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A4.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A4.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">humanlike _ _ _ _ _ machinelike</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">conscious _ _ _ _ _ unconscious</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">lifelike _ _ _ _ _ artificial</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A4.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">elegant _ _ _ _ _ rigid</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Additional Analyses</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A5.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix E Additional Analyses ‣ Vibe Check: Understanding the Effects of LLM-Based Conversational Agents’ Personality and Alignment on User Perceptions in Goal-Oriented Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> presents the model selection for <math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-means clustering.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F12" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.09870v1/clustering_analysis.svg" id="A5.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/156;" width="476" height="156"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12. </span>Model selection for <math id="A5.F12.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-means clustering. Left (Elbow): within-cluster sum of squares drops steeply from <math id="A5.F12.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A5.F12.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}3</annotation></semantics></math> and then flattens, indicating an elbow at <math id="A5.F12.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{\approx}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{\approx}3</annotation></semantics></math>. Right (Silhouette): scores are highest at very small <math id="A5.F12.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> and decrease thereafter; at <math id="A5.F12.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}3</annotation></semantics></math> the silhouette is <math id="A5.F12.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx.31" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>.31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx.31</annotation></semantics></math>. Balancing fit and parsimony, we select <math id="A5.F12.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}3</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
